        "nazev": "Building services design",
        "kratky": "All stages of project documentation including BIM, cost estimation, and site supervision.",
        "titulek": "Building services design — from feasibility study to construction documentation",
        "lead": "A design you can actually build from. We prepare all stages of documentation, monitor interfaces between disciplines, and stay involved until handover.",
        "popis": "Our designers work on building services drawings every day and also visit construction sites — and it shows in the drawings. We prepare documentation for every stage, from feasibility study through building permit design and construction documentation to as-built documentation, entirely in BIM if needed.",
        "body": {
          "b1": "Site survey and local assessment before the first line is drawn",
          "b2": "All project stages as specified, including itemised cost estimation",
          "b3": "Missing input data arranged by agreement (surveying, diagnostics, asset register)",
          "b4": "Coordination with other disciplines and interface management between individual designs",
