      "realizace-montaze": {
        "nazev": "Installation and commissioning",
        "kratky": "Supply and installation of HVAC, cooling, heating, plumbing, gas, and heat pumps.",
        "titulek": "Building services supply and installation",
        "lead": "We are a partner throughout the entire process — from project preparation through installation to handover to the investor. Including construction supervision.",
        "popis": "We are a team of technicians with over 30 years of experience in building services engineering. We rely on experience as well as new insights from an industry that continues to evolve dynamically — and on the fact that our service team knows the building before they take it over.",
