      "servis": {
        "nazev": "Service and maintenance",
        "kratky": "Regular service, inspections, and a 24/7 control desk for all building services systems.",
        "titulek": "Building services with a 24/7 control desk",
        "lead": "Several teams of core technicians with full equipment and a control desk that runs 365 days a year.",
        "popis": "We service what we have built as well as what we take over from others. We work in teams of two; where the nature of the intervention does not require it, a single technician is dispatched — so you do not unnecessarily pay for a second person.",
