        "nazev": "Heating System Refit at a Logistics Center Near the D1 Motorway",
        "misto": "Central Bohemian Region",
        "perex": "An energy audit showed that it was worthwhile to keep the distribution network and replace only the heat sources and controls. Gas consumption dropped by a third.",
        "zadani": "The operator of the logistics complex wanted to reduce heating costs for the halls and the office section. The original plan was to replace the entire boiler room.",
        "rozsah": {
          "r1": "Energy audit of the entire complex, including two solution variants",
          "r2": "Gas boiler room refit — existing distribution retained, new condensing heat sources installed",
          "r3": "New weather-compensated control system and integration with the building's BMS",
          "r4": "Hydraulic balancing of the heating system, including a protocol",
          "r5": "Preparation of an Energy Performance Certificate (PENB) after completion of the measures"
