        "vysledek": "The investment came in approximately 40 % lower than the proposed full replacement. After the first heating season, gas consumption dropped by roughly a third, and the complex met the mandatory inspection requirements for operated systems."
      },
      "administrativni-budova-karlin": {
        "nazev": "HVAC and Cooling for an Office Building in Karlín",
        "misto": "Prague 8",
        "perex": "Replacement of two AHU units and reconstruction of the chilled water distribution in a six-story building — while tenants remained fully operational.",
        "zadani": "The building owner needed to replace end-of-life units and increase cooling capacity without requiring tenants to vacate their offices for even a single day.",
